    "Id": "chassisdef_demomax_DX-2",
    "Name": "DemoMax",
    "Details": "The DemoMax DX-2 wields a wrecking ball in the left arm for pulverizing structures, alongside a dual saw in the right arm for slicing through stubborn materials. A flamer and small laser in each side torso round out the loadout, offering both softening power and precision work.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.77</color></b>",
