  "StockRole": "Industrial Mech",
  "YangsThoughts": "The DemoMax was built by MaxTech for the exact opposite of its construction focused siblings, dedicated entirely to demolition and destruction work. It became one of the rare MaxTech designs to sell in near record numbers, prized for being easy to pilot and versatile enough to handle nearly any wrecking job. Its heavy industrial armor protects it from the everyday hazards of debris and workplace accidents, though it notably lacks environmental sealing, leaving it grounded compared to something like the SpacerMax.",
